{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af52a97c2ddb05a7fe2e710","chatId":"6723b6582f584307a53ddab54d982ed9","sessionId":null,"userId":77657,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":873,"promptTokens":1572,"completionTokens":4,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:55:19"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.02032830127241671,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a97c2ddb05a7fe2e70f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452119591,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:55:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af52a97c2ddb05a7fe2e70f","chatId":"6723b6582f584307a53ddab54d982ed9","sessionId":null,"userId":77657,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n小华和小强一起去动物园，看到了小兔子觉得非常可爱，而小强也给小兔子喂了胡萝卜。小华清楚知道动物园是不允许私自给动物喂食不明来源的食物的，但他没告诉小强。他们走后，听见动物园饲养员说小兔子出现不良反应，小华便上前询问，才意识到自己行为的不妥。\n\n[问题]\n小华没有告诉小强关于动物园禁止喂食的规则，他会感到什么样的情绪？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 小华可能会感到内疚和焦虑，因为他没有告诉小强动物园的规则，导致了小兔子的不良反应。\nB. 小华可能感到无动于衷，因为他认为小强喂食小兔子不会导致严重后果。\nC. 小华可能感到高兴，因为他认为小强喂食小兔子是一种表达爱心的行。\nD. 小华可能感到困惑，因为他不确定是否应该在这种情况下告知小强动物园的规则。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.02032830127241671,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a97c2ddb05a7fe2e710","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452119588,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:55:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"84a26395922d4eb4acef8cf3384541e6"}